#Coalition finale (act 3, the branch where the player refused Bolthar): Bolthar and his four
#lieutenants - kobold, ratkin, goblin, dwarf - plus the goblin's summoned bomb.
#Every code here is prefixed coal_. Units live in enemydata.gd, traits in Traits.gd.
#
#Shared conventions:
# - "Unity of the Coalition" auras: a TR_COMBAT_S trait trigger casts a hidden ally-wide skill
#   that hangs a temp_global on every ally; the global dies with its caster (TR_DEATH timer).
# - reactive passives (heal an ally, poison a crit victim, bomb a healed enemy, cover an ally)
#   are sub-triggers of a temp_global seeded onto the watched units; `watcher` is the unit that
#   reacts and its once-per-round budget is the counterattacks stat (refilled every round).
# - "only when all other allies are defeated" = {code = 'group_amount', alive = true, operant = 'eq', value = 1}

